  "orgDesign": {
    "domainId": "vehicle-data-and-dealer-saas-platform",
    "domainName": "Vehicle Data and Dealer SaaS Platform",
    "companyProfile": "VWE Automotive (VWE Groep B.V., Heerhugowaard; offices in Heerhugowaard and Veghel) calls itself the number one in vehicle data in the Netherlands and the largest officially recognised RDW provider, serving 11,000+ business customers (September 2026). Products include MijnVWE, Occasion Manager, Finnik, RDW services, data products and APIs; acquisitions include AVN Group (2022), Cargo and XRAY Automotive (2026); ATC was sold to Autorola in February 2026. NewPort Capital invested in 2022; Main Capital Partners agreed in 2026 to take a majority stake. Magnet.me lists about 125 employees at HQ.",
    "operatingModel": "Modeled: product teams aligned to dealer, trade, data and consumer streams build on a shared vehicle-data and valuation core and an accounts/billing platform, with a small enabling team for data licensing and compliance. Team names and headcounts are illustrative, sized for a company of roughly 125–160 employees, not VWE's actual structure."
